OL,3,GNEWSAI watched as a hijacked plane flew
OL,4,Aover my home - moments later my wife
OL,5,Awas killed on 9/11
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhen a plane flew low over Charles
OL,8,FWolf's New York City apartment on a
OL,9,Fsunny morning 25 years ago, he knew
OL,10,Fimmediately that something was wrong.
OL,12,FSeconds later, the plane slammed into
OL,13,Fthe north tower of the World Trade
OL,14,FCenter - where his wife Katherine, from
OL,15,FSwansea, was working.
OL,17,FKatherine died instantly, becoming one
OL,18,Fof 2,977 people killed in the al-Qaeda
OL,19,Fterrorist attacks on the USA on 11
OL,20,FSeptember, 2001.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
