OL,3,GNEWSAI watched as a hijacked plane flew
OL,4,Aover my home - moments later my wife
OL,5,Awas killed on 9/11
OL,6,
OL,7,FCharles, who subsequently led a
OL,8,Fcampaign to ensure the victims'
OL,9,Ffamilies and dependants were fairly
OL,10,Fcompensated, said his "wonderful" wife
OL,11,Fwould be proud of what he fought for.
